  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance alimentaire et nutritionnelle pour sauver les vies des personnes vuln&#xe9;rables pendant la p&#xe9;riode de soudure au Burkina Faso, et fourniture de services logistiques pour l&#x2019;acc&#xe8;s aux zones d&#x2019;interventions humanitaires</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide Food Security assistance to people affected by food insecurity in Sahel (Provinces de Soum, Oudalan et Yagha) and Boucle du Mouhoun (Province de Sourou) regions. This WFP project provides humanitarian assistance to 40,270 people, including 8,073 women, 6,893 men, 25,304 children, and including 483 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
